<title>USA: Sphere Drake charges due to restructuring.</title>
<headline>Sphere Drake charges due to restructuring.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sphere Drake Holdings Ltd said Monday it will incur special charges against earnings totaling $15 million over the next three quarters.</p>
<p>The company said the charges will result from restructuring.  </p>
<p>Sphere Drake said the restructuring is designed to improve customer focus, financial performance and stability and only participate in its most profitable lines of business.</p>
</text>
